## Menu: Themes

YAML anchors are processed by `pyyaml` prior to being loaded in the [Application](#application). They should be used like a theme or stylesheet. Declare theme variables (anchors) at the top of each [Menu Model](#menu-model) and reference them to consistently "style" the Menu.

```yaml
# ------------------------------------ THEME: MENU - <menu>
themes:
  colors:
    pane: &pane dark-solid
    pane-alt: &pane-alt dark-texture
  alignments:
    top: &top
      horizontal: center
      vertical: start
    center: &center
      horizontal: center
      vertical: center
    start: &start
      horizontal: start
      vertical: center
  dimensions:
    root: &root
      pw: 0.67
      pl: 0.80
    column: &column
      pw: 0.32
      pl: 0.60
# --------------------------------------------------------------
```